WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.279 --> 00:00:03.112
(soft calm music)

00:00:07.877 --> 00:00:08.979
- [Narrator] Deep in the Namibian desert

00:00:08.979 --> 00:00:10.896
is a place time forgot.

00:00:16.153 --> 00:00:18.419
Once a German colony, minors flocked here

00:00:18.419 --> 00:00:21.459
after diamonds were discovered in 1908.

00:00:21.459 --> 00:00:24.600
The town grew quickly, fueled
by the enormous wealth.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.683
Hidden beneath the sands.

00:00:29.576 --> 00:00:31.895
But as the diamonds disappeared
and production relocated,

00:00:31.895 --> 00:00:34.077
the town was left completely abandoned,

00:00:34.077 --> 00:00:37.973
to be slowly consumed by
the ever shifting desert.

00:00:37.973 --> 00:00:40.973
(soft upbeat music)

